# Copy this file to `.env` in this skill's folder (or at the project root) and fill it in.
# Every key is OPTIONAL: without them the pipeline works, only the matching online searches are off.
# Never commit the `.env`.

# Image search (illustration photos, covers, portraits): serp_images.py
# Key from serpapi.com (free plan: 250 searches per month, spend them carefully).
SERPAPI_API_KEY=

# GIF search: gifs.py. Free key at developers.giphy.com ("Create an API key").
GIPHY_API_KEY=

# --- Environment variables (export them in the shell, they are not read from this file) ---
# MONTAGE_DEPOT   folder for the work files of render-segments.py (default: the system temp folder).
#                 Useful if the project lives in a synced folder.
# MONTAGE_CACHE   cache of site-demo recordings (default: ~/.cache/kit-montage/screencast)
# DERUSH_WEBHOOK  URL of your own service for the semantic step of the rough cut (optional; without it,
#                 the AI does that step itself in the conversation).
# KIT_SKILLS      folder where the skills live, for examples/plan-example.py (default: ~/.claude/skills)

# whisper.cpp: `whisper-cli` binary in the PATH, model in ~/Models/whisper/ggml-large-v3-turbo.bin
# (see INSTALL.md of the kit).
